  "description": "```\nvar timer= new RecordingStopwatch().Start();\ntimer.Add(\"Event1\");\ntimer.Add(\"Event2\");\nConsole.Outline( timer.ToString() );\nvar record= timer.Timings.Select(t=> (t.Event, t.SecondsElapse)).ToList();\ntimer.Stop();\ntimer.ClearAndStart();\n```",
